# Presentation Summary

## Title: AI-Powered Railway Surveillance & Analytics
- **Objective**: Enhance platform safety, detect anomalies, streamline worker management, and monitor cleanliness automatically.
- **Key Modules**:
  1. Crowd Density & Flow Analysis
  2. Criminal / Blacklist Person Identification
  3. Real-time Anomaly & Fall Detection
  4. Automatic Cleanliness Scoring
  5. Worker Attendance & Zone Tracking
  6. Live Dashboard & Multi-channel Alerts
